{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-01_end","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-01","title":"合流","storyCode":"3-1","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"74660e59cbc2fb3b8e2afab9211073a373970bc6a5511274214806d5b8334523","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"レユニオンはその大部分が撤退したようだ。彼らの関係者と思しき人々も口を割らない状況下、ロドスと近衛局はミーシャ奪還のため、改めて共同での行動を開始する。\nロドスが捜索と切り込み役を、ペンギン急便がその補助を、そして近衛局が主力部隊を務める形で、彼らは動き出した。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十三关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"ご報告します。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"どうした。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"レユニオンの大部分が撤退したようです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"チェン隊長。こちらも、一通りの対処は完了しました。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……わかった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"ならば、数日前に捕らえた、レユニオン構成員と思しき容疑者たちはどうだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"何か、奴らから聞き出せたことは？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_21_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"容疑者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"このクロスボウに見覚えはあるか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"容疑者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……では、扱い方はわかるか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"弾薬の構造はどうなっている？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"それに、スラムで何をしていた？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――龍門で、一体何をするつもりだったんだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"容疑者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……いえ、何も聞き出せていません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奴らはずっとだんまりでして。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あるいは……本当に、何も知らないのかもしれませんが。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"その場合、先ほど制圧した連中と同じで、命令に従うだけの手駒みたいなものなんでしょうね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"――なんとしても口を割らせろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"そのためなら、何かしらの方法を取っても構わん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"小隊の情報、指揮の方針、情報源、部隊の配置状況……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"奴らの知るすべてを引き出すんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"その上で、内容は残さず私に報告しろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"どのようなことでも、新しい情報であれば、即刻伝達するように。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"了解！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"もしかして、近衛局のほうではすでに、レユニオンの構成員を捕縛していたんですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"いや。正確には、その疑いがある人物しか押さえられていない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"いくら推測を重ねたところで、容疑は容疑にすぎないからな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"――ホシグマに連絡を！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"主力部隊の状況はどうだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"まさか今も、例の感染者に勝手を許しているのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"それが、向こうのレユニオンも撤退した様子とのことで……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"おとり作戦の可能性を警戒して、ホシグマ督察が調査に当たられているそうです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"チッ。相手は一人だというのに……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"行くも戻るも、奴の気の向くまま、とは。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ。次の任務はわかっているな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"やはり、ミーシャさんの奪還……ですね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"その通りだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"今回はキミたちにも、共同で動いてもらいたい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局が攻撃の主体となる。そこでロドスには、対象の捜索と切り込み役を担当してもらおう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"とは言っても、戦闘のほうは、撤退するレユニオンを足止めしてくれるだけで構わない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……わかりました。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"でも、レユニオンを探すってなると……逆にこっちが見つかるリスクもあるわよね？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"今でさえ、偵察チームはサポートが足りてないっていうのに……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"あたしたちだけじゃ、どうしようもないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"であれば、ここは専門家を頼りましょうか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"フランカさん、ペンギン急便に連絡してください。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"もう一度、お二人の手をお借りするしかないようですから。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["チェン"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局隊員"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["フランカ"]}]}
